# Snyx - Authoritative Real-Time Synchronized Watchroom Platform

**Snyx** is a full-stack, real-time web platform built for synchronous YouTube video watching, music listening, live chat, and social interaction among friends. Built using a modern TypeScript monorepo architecture, Snyx leverages WebSockets (Socket.IO), NestJS, React, Prisma ORM, and PostgreSQL to deliver sub-second playback synchronization across client devices.

