## 5. Key Feature Breakdown

### Watchrooms & Playback Sync
- Short room codes (e.g. `UMI-7X4K`) generated automatically.
- Play, pause, seek, load video, and next track synchronized instantly for all participants.
- Room presence tracking with active online badges.
- **Room Participant Kick/Removal**: Clicking the online users badge opens a participants modal, allowing anyone in the room to remove any other participant in real time.
- **Exit Room Button**: Quick exit button in both the header navbar and room controls bar.

### Interactive Queue
- Search YouTube directly from the room sidebar or paste YouTube video links.
- Queue items display video title, thumbnail, and duration.
- Drag & drop reordering of queue items.
- Auto-advances to next queue item when current track ends.

### Live Chat & Reactions
- Real-time room chat with custom profile picture reflection.
- Message replies (swipe-to-reply gesture supported on mobile/touch).
- Message editing (within 2 minutes of sending) with `(edited)` tag.
- Message un-sending / deletion.
- Emoji reactions (`❤️`, `😂`, `😮`, `😢`, `👍`, `🔥`) with real-time reaction counts.
- Infinite scroll pagination to load older message history.
- Floating toast notifications when new messages arrive while viewing other tabs.

### Social System & Profiles
- User profiles with custom avatars, banners, bios, and gender selection.
- Follow/Friend request management.
- Watchroom invitations sent directly to active friends.
- Direct messaging inbox modal accessible globally via navbar.

