## 7. API Endpoints

### Authentication & Profile (`/auth`)
- `POST /auth/signup`: Create a new user account.
- `POST /auth/login`: Authenticate and obtain user token.
- `POST /auth/profile`: Update profile picture, bio, banner, display name, gender.

### Watchrooms (`/rooms`)
- `POST /rooms`: Create a new watchroom and return room code.
- `GET /rooms/:id`: Fetch room details and queue.
- `GET /rooms/:id/messages?before=:id&limit=50`: Paginated room chat history.

### YouTube (`/youtube`)
- `GET /youtube/search?q=:query`: Search YouTube videos (uses YouTube Data API v3 or fallback mock library).
- `GET /youtube/video/:id`: Fetch YouTube video details for direct link pastes.

### Social & Friends (`/social`)
- `GET /social/friends`: Fetch user's friends list.
- `POST /social/invites/:friendId`: Send watchroom invite to friend.
- `GET /social/invites`: Fetch pending watchroom invites.

