## 8. Setup & Running Instructions

### Prerequisites
- Node.js 18+ and npm
- PostgreSQL database (or Docker for local container)

### Installation
1. Clone repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/introversh/snyx.git
   cd snyx
   ```
2. Install dependencies:
   ```bash
   npm install
   ```
3. Set environment variables (`.env` in root & `apps/api/.env`):
   ```env
   DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/snyx"
   YOUTUBE_API_KEY="your_youtube_api_key_here"
   VITE_API_URL="http://localhost:3000"
   VITE_SOCKET_URL="http://localhost:3000"
   ```
4. Run Prisma database migrations:
   ```bash
   npm run prisma:migrate --workspace=@youtube-together/api
   ```

### Running Development Servers
- Start backend API & Socket.IO server:
  ```bash
  npm run dev --workspace=@youtube-together/api
  ```
- Start frontend Vite dev server:
  ```bash
  npm run dev --workspace=@youtube-together/web
  ```

### Building for Production
Build all packages (`shared`, `api`, `web`):
```bash
npm run build
```
